    SquadPlanningFocusVisual --> VoxelCharacterUnitVisual : ボクセル本体の半透明化と復元
    GameTransition --> Rendering.CombatFrontlineUI : Stage生成後にAttach
    SquadReachabilityCalculator --> SquadMovementProfile
    SquadReachabilityCalculator --> GridNavigator
