    BalanceParameterSearch --> BalanceParameterSpace : frozen baseline / bounded candidates
    BalanceParameterSearch --> BalanceRoleEvaluator : train selection / individual and joint validation / joint holdout
    BalanceParameterSearch --> LabArtifacts : candidate files / recommended experiment
    BalanceRoleEvaluator --> LabConfig : copied ally parameters only
    BalanceRoleEvaluator --> BalanceScriptedPolicy : frozen deployment rules
    BalanceRoleEvaluator --> BattleLabAdapter : repeated battle trials
    note as BalanceRoleTargets
      Explicit targets per role and reference cost; no inferred ideal balance.
      Initial search changes HP and power, with speed and cost fixed.
      Enemy baseline remains frozen. No automatic writes to Unity assets.
    end note
    BalanceRoleTargets .. BalanceParameterSearch
}
